                  {
                    "value": "Duplicate customers fixed. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#F05100"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "The Customers sheet had 307 rows for 302 IDs (CUST0001 x4, CUST0300 x3, one blank ID). The query keeps the most complete row per ID and drops one stub row (CUST0301, first name only): 300 customers.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#020618"
